  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Lately been experiencing a lot of lagging/freezing of other people their IKs in worlds.. sometimes everyone experiences it and sometimes it's client based. The new update that came out today didn't resolve it and it seems to be an every day occurence as of this week or so.\n\nA year ago this never happened and I hear a lot of changes has happened into how IK works.. potentially for the quest as well?\n\nThe current fix would be to restart vrchat for some.. I am wondering as a temporary measure till the problem has been fixed to add a button to settings to re-initialize a connection with the world/IK server would fix this issue without a required restart?",
